# Dormant Powers Dislodged (jeuno 136), the level cap alone either side of 90: a level 86 Warrior with the Limit Breaker,
# the three earlier limit breaks completed. Cap 89 and 91: no section (Prelude to Puissance wants Dormant Powers
# Dislodged completed), the default 10045 (0, 0, 2, 0), no draw; cap 90: the draw, 10045 (86, 1, 4, 0, 0, drawn).
lists RuludeGardens/Nomad_Moogle/onTrigger RuludeGardens/onEventFinish/10045
char zone=RuludeGardens pos=10.0,1.5,119.9 job=WAR lvl=86
keyitem LimitBreaker
levelcap 89
quest Jeuno.NewWorldsAwait completed
quest Jeuno.ExpandingHorizons completed
quest Jeuno.BeyondTheStars completed
login
trigger Nomad_Moogle                    # cap 89: no section; the default 10045 (0, 0, 2, 0)
finish
levelcap 91                             # a GM
trigger Nomad_Moogle                    # cap 91: no section; the default 10045 (0, 0, 2, 0)
finish
levelcap 90                             # a GM
trigger Nomad_Moogle                    # cap 90: 10045 (86, 1, 4, 0, 0, drawn)
finish option=0
